<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Scott returns four weeks after his consultation. His home readings over the last week average 136/86 mmHg. He has cut his salt and trains three times a week, walking fast with a weighted pack and running, and has lost about a kilogram. He has not smoked his pipe for five weeks; the nausea on varenicline has gone. He gave the urine sample a week ago. He has had his dental examination and cleaning, his hearing test, and an eye examination. He sleeps six to seven hours and his mood is good. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Home blood pressure</td><td>Seven-day average 136/86 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>Less salt; training three times a week; weight down about 1 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Tobacco</td><td>No pipe for five weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Checks</td><td>Dental, hearing, and eye examinations done</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

